---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q7"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |  Sort: supp_nation ASC NULLS LAST, cust_nation ASC NULLS LAST, l_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Projection: supplier.su_nationkey AS supp_nation, substr(customer.c_state,Int64(1),Int64(1)) AS cust_nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"),oorder.o_entry_d) AS l_year, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[supplier.su_nationkey, substr(customer.c_state, Int64(1), Int64(1)), date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), oorder.o_entry_d)]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       Inner Join:  Filter: ascii(substr(customer.c_state, Int64(1), Int64(1))) - Int64(65) = n2.n_nationkey AND (n1.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("CHINA") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("CHINA") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN"))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |         Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: customer.c_id = oorder.o_c_id AND customer.c_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND customer.c_d_id = oorder.o_d_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_w_id = oorder.o_w_id AND order_line.ol_d_id = oorder.o_d_id AND order_line.ol_o_id = oorder.o_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_supply_w_id = stock.s_w_id AND order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000)) = supplier.su_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                   TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |                   TableScan: stock projection=[s_i_id, s_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                 TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_o_id, ol_d_id, ol_w_id, ol_i_id, ol_supply_w_id, ol_amount]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |               TableScan: oorder projection=[o_id, o_d_id, o_w_id, o_c_id, o_entry_d]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |             TableScan: customer projection=[c_id, c_d_id, c_w_id, c_state]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |           Filter: n1.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("CHINA")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |             SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |               TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[nation.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN") OR nation.n_name = Utf8("CHINA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |         Filter: n2.n_name = Utf8("CHINA") OR n2.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |           SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |             TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[nation.n_name = Utf8("CHINA") OR nation.n_name = Utf8("JAPAN")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "supplier"."su_nationkey" AS "supp_nation", substr("customer"."c_state", 1, 1) AS "cust_nation", date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") AS "l_year", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "revenue" FROM "supplier" INNER JOIN "stock" ON (mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) = "supplier"."su_suppkey") INNER JOIN "order_line" ON (("order_line"."ol_supply_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id")) INNER JOIN "oorder" ON ((("order_line"."ol_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_o_id" = "oorder"."o_id")) INNER JOIN "customer" ON ((("customer"."c_id" = "oorder"."o_c_id") AND ("customer"."c_w_id" = "oorder"."o_w_id")) AND ("customer"."c_d_id" = "oorder"."o_d_id")) INNER JOIN "nation" AS "n1" ON (("supplier"."su_nationkey" = "n1"."n_nationkey") AND (("n1"."n_name" = 'JAPAN') OR ("n1"."n_name" = 'CHINA'))) INNER JOIN "nation" AS "n2" ON ((((ascii(substr("customer"."c_state", 1, 1)) - 65) = "n2"."n_nationkey") AND ((("n1"."n_name" = 'JAPAN') AND ("n2"."n_name" = 'CHINA')) OR (("n1"."n_name" = 'CHINA') AND ("n2"."n_name" = 'JAPAN')))) AND (("n2"."n_name" = 'CHINA') OR ("n2"."n_name" = 'JAPAN'))) GROUP BY "supplier"."su_nationkey", substr("customer"."c_state", 1, 1), date_part('YEAR', "oorder"."o_entry_d") ORDER BY "supp_nation" ASC NULLS LAST, "cust_nation" ASC NULLS LAST, "l_year" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
